{"channelId":"UCFdoh4Ng1Ji1nGR7SeUoGtg","row":["PEACE Rescue & Support",56,"People Ensuring Animal Care Exists (P.E.A.C.E.) is a registered Canadian charity established to help farmed animals and farm sanctuaries through resources, rescues and education. \n\nRESOURCES\nwww.peacecanada.org/resources\nOn our website: free and discounted resources for Canadian farm sanctuaries, from discounted lawyer fees to help sanctuaries get their charity status to free technology and grant options for projects! We also organize events, education classes, and workshops for farm sanctuaries, the public, teachers, and other non-profits. Also on our website: come find your local sanctuaries by region, resources if you would like to start a sanctuary yourself, and so much more!\n\nRESCUES\nwww.peacecanada.org/rescues\nWe started in 2019 to help farm sanctuaries and farmed animals as we saw a need for an organization dedicated to helping with rescue and transport of farmed animals in BC, Canada. \n\nEDUCATION\nTo learn more about P.E.A.C.E. Humane, visit www.peacehumane.org","","Canada"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFdoh4Ng1Ji1nGR7SeUoGtg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFdoh4Ng1Ji1nGR7SeUoGtg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:19:40.149Z","channelId":"UCFdoh4Ng1Ji1nGR7SeUoGtg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"a5f7349ad082515c56b7f333eb2c5b34b1159857eaad4fd02b9014e832b96eed","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"0a8ecd1efd6c1574b06255211837dd21049c9a2e292da8090dd7de325e673c77"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFdoh4Ng1Ji1nGR7SeUoGtg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:19:40.149Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFdoh4Ng1Ji1nGR7SeUoGtg","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":56,"raw":"56 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFdoh4Ng1Ji1nGR7SeUoGtg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:19:40.149Z"}],"emails":[],"